<title>UK: Clyde to release defence document on Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Clyde to release defence document on Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clyde Petroleum Plc, eyed by Gulf Canada Resources Ltd, said the takeover and mergers panel had allowed it to release its defence document on January 6 instead of January 3.</p>
<p>The company, for which Gulf Canada launched a 432 million hostile bid, may publish its defence circuclar later than normally required because of the current public holiday period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
